00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:31.919
qualifier leading up to the main
tournament. Questioning the organizer's

00:06:31.919 --> 00:06:36.300
decision to separate the two genders.
When the IeSF stepped in to defend

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:40.380
themselves, they said that their decision
to separate the two genders was part of

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:44.300
