00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.420
We have evidence that this actually happened so.
Yeah.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.660
The world was furious.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.820
No one could understand how such an outdated

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:55.710
