00:06:55.710 --> 00:07:00.720
Finally, just a day after the IeSF
statement went viral, the company decided

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:03.580
to open up its tournaments to all
participants.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.520
A huge victory guys a huge victory.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:06.020
Yeah.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.940
Yeah, well done and well played.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.820
Thought the scandals of 2013 and 2014 were big.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.320
No amount of heartbreak and

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:16.980
disappointment could prepare the esports
community from what would later be known

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:22.040
as one of esports most successful yet
