00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.740
In January of 2015,

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:28.860
CS:GO's fans were reeling from what
could only be described as the biggest

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:32.860
match-fixing scandal of the games short
competitive lifespan.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:36.360
Netcode Guides beating iBUYPOWER on Season.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:39.520
iBUYPOWER's CS:GO team consisted of North America's

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:45.300
best in-game leader DaZeD, a brilliant
support player AZK an NA super talent

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:49.700
steel, one of the best AWPer's in the
world Skadoodle, and eighteen-year-old

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:54.540
CS:GO genius swag, and they knowingly
threw their match against Netcode Guides.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:59.140
A team that they would have typically
trounced back in August 2014.

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:04.260
There was already some speculation that the match
was thrown as soon as it ended, but it

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:07.720
was quickly brushed aside as nothing
more than a rumor.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.400
This is just really surprising.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:13.980
The story then later
resurfaced in 2015 when esports

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:17.790
journalist Richard Lewis brought to
light incriminating text messages that

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:21.260
Derek "dboorn" Boorn sent to his
ex-girlfriend.

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:23.380
Valve responded in January 2015,

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:27.900
and they banned indefinitely four of the five members of the team, as well as

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.930
several others in a
highly publicized blog post entitled

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:33.060
Integrity and Fairplay.

00:08:33.100 --> 00:08:36.219
It happens, from
baseball to boxing, professional athletes

00:08:36.219 --> 00:08:40.089
have taken dives for bribes from
professional gamblers it destroys the

00:08:40.089 --> 00:08:41.940
integrity of the game.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.470
Then in February
of 2015,

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:48.960
League of Legends was hit with the
scandal of astronomical proportions.

