In 2016,
esports as a whole took yet another step

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:03.610
forward as interest in the industry
turned into even more money, as multiple

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:08.050
investors entered the space in various
forms. But while the rest of the

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:12.660
