00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:27.760
President Trevor Martin and Vice President

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:30.340
Thomas Cassell.
So these two own the website

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:35.600
CSGOLotto.com and the allegedly do fake
gambling and pretend to win thousands of

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:38.940
dollars and also sometimes pretend to
lose it too.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.319
Without disclosing that they

00:11:40.319 --> 00:11:44.220
were owners of the website, fellow
youtubers Trevor "TmarTn" Martin and

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:49.019
Thomas "ProSyndicate" Cassell promoted
CS:GO Lotto to their combined audience of

00:11:49.019 --> 00:11:53.309
10 million subscribers. When the shady
dealings came to light, Valve

00:11:53.309 --> 00:11:57.299
